<title>USA: Equity Residential completes offering.</title>
<headline>Equity Residential completes offering.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equity Residential Properties Trust said Thursday it completed a $175 million offering of depositary shares.</p>
<p>The offering consisted of seven million depositary shares of its 8.6 percent series D cumulative redeemable preferred shares of beneficial interest at $25 a piece, the company said.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the offering will be used to acquire additional multi-family residential properties and to repay amounts outstanding under its line of credit. The $175 million in proceeds excludes underwriting fees, Equity Residential said.</p>
<p>(( -- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
